 # UnderWeb X changelog
 
+## 0.6.8-rc27 — Group Intelligence & Moderation Center
+
+- **Group Intel tab** (group staff and UnderWeb staff): live member and online counts, pending requests, invites and bans from VRChat. Member growth over 24 h, 7 d, 30 d and all recorded, built from snapshots. Joins, leaves, kicks, bans, role changes and instances by period, compared with the period before. Live group instances (with a "full" alert), charts with date filters, an activity feed with search, sort, filters and CSV export, and Road to 500. Every number is labelled Current, Historical or Estimate, and anything VRChat won't give you says Unavailable and why.
+- Refreshes every 1–30 min (you pick). Shows the last sync and the next one. Backs off automatically if VRChat rate-limits.
+- **Shared history:** once a group is registered with UnderWeb, staff clients pool counts and audit history into one archive. It never sends VRChat logins or tokens.
+- **Road to 500:** the leaderboard shows only recruits a manager has verified. Members submit a recruit's VRChat link (the recruit needs no UnderWeb account). Managers see join and invite evidence from the audit log and confirm or reject. Nothing is credited automatically.
+- **Moderation tab — User Intelligence:** look anyone up by name, usr_ id, profile link, friend or someone in your instance. It shows their VRChat profile, group membership, linked UnderWeb account, and the "Known Recorded" bans, kicks, warnings and incidents (with "History unavailable" when you can't see logs). It also shows reports partner groups chose to share, a combined timeline, shared staff notes and private notes.
+- **Moderation tab — Cases:** incident cases with statuses Open, Under Review, Escalated, Resolved, Dismissed and Appealed. Assign to staff, record warnings, kicks and bans, attach private evidence, and record appeals and decisions. The timeline is append-only. Remove, ban and unban run in VRChat from the case after a confirmation plus the 10 s undo.
+- **Access by UnderWeb role, set per group by its owner:** Viewer, Moderator, Manager or Owner, with Trial Staff included. The settings also cover the member goal, retention, Moderation Network opt-in, who to share with and how much, and an access log.
+
 ## 0.6.7-rc26 — Approvals for staff
 
 - **Approvals tab** (UnderWeb staff): the same queues as Staff on underweb.cloud, right inside UWX — photos & work (with a private preview), hub cards, role applications, VRChat checks and events. Approve or deny in one click; the UnderWeb server still decides what your role is allowed to approve.
