+// Live numbers come from VRChat with your own session (the same requests VRCX makes):
+//   GET groups/{id}                          member + online counts (anyone in the group)
+//   GET groups/{id}/bans|invites|requests    counted in pages of 100 (only with the matching VRChat permission)
